      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brook_Park%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village of Brook Park was officially incorporated on October 1 1919, solidifying its municipal status.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brook_Park%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "On September 1 1894, the Great Hinckley Fire devastated Brook Park and the surrounding township.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brook_Park%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A monument in Brook Park’s cemetery marks a mass grave of 23 unidentified victims of the 1894 fire.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24
