      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brook_Park%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "At its founding, Brook Park was known as Pokegama, a name that reflected local indigenous heritage.",
